iscovery-schedule-run-options.md","line":74},{"title":"Use Global Excludes List for IP addresses and ranges","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery/discovery-ip-address-configuration.md","line":81},{"title":"Define CI field attributes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery/define-ci-attributes.md","line":82},{"title":"Discovery behaviors","target":"c_DiscoveryBehaviors","line":83},{"title":"Discovery behaviors","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery/c_DiscoveryBehaviors.md","line":83},{"title":"Discovery Quick Start","target":"discovery-quick-start","line":108},{"title":"IP network discovery","target":"r_DataCollDiscoIPNetworks","line":113},{"title":"discovery status","target":"c_DiscoveryStatus","line":127},{"title":"Discovery Home page","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery/discovery-home-page.md","line":257},{"title":"remediation","target":"ccg-remediation","line":259},{"title":"Error details","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery/discovery-home-page.md","line":259},{"title":"MID Server pause","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/t_PauseTheMIDServer.md","line":309},{"title":"MID Server cluster configuration","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/t_ConfigureAMIDServerCluster.md","line":311},{"title":"Discovery","target":"r-discovery","line":315},{"title":"Service Mapping","target":"c_ServiceMappingOverview","line":316},{"title":"Discovery behaviors","target":"c_DiscoveryBehaviors","line":317},{"title":"D